			"dialogs": [
				{
					"id": 733560101,
					"content": "真令人不敢相信，我居然有一天能喝妳泡的茶。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560102
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560102,
					"content": "有那麼稀奇嗎？我不過是想感謝感謝你為「數秘陣列」提供的算力核心罷了。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560103
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560103,
					"content": "另外，你幹嘛老是說一些好像很懂我們的話？看起來真的很自來熟欸。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560104
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560104,
					"content": "說過了，我只是恰好很會看人而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560105
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560105,
					"content": "不過…哈，你說得對。我不該再自認為很瞭解你們。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560106
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560106,
					"content": "嗯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560107
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560107,
					"content": "光是從上次見面算起，妳看起來就變了很多。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560108
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560108,
					"content": "不然你還要從多久前算起？哼，我不過是接受了自己核心中的「錯繆」，看清了一些事情而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560109
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560109,
					"content": "你呢？同為某種「人偶」的你，內心也會有什麼時候出現計算的錯繆嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560110
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560110,
					"content": "哈…何止是「錯繆」呢？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560111
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560111,
					"content": "說來聽聽？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560112
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560112,
					"content": "我們還沒熟到那種地步。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560113
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560113,
					"content": "哈，也對。我也就禮節性問問而已。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560114
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560114,
					"content": "不管怎麼說，人偶在尋找「心」這件事上，恐怕都會繞不少彎路——至少我是這樣。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560115
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560115,
					"content": "妳似乎同創造了妳的人關係不錯？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560116
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560116,
					"content": "嗯，他給予了我很多幫助和指引，不論是生前還是死後。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560117
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560117,
					"content": "那這點上我就同妳有根本性的區別。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560118
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560118,
					"content": "哦…這樣嗎？",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560119
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560119,
					"content": "抱歉，雖說在「人偶」這點上有些相似，但我也不該就此覺得理解了你什麼。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560120
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560120,
					"content": "不，別在意。用妳的說法，我也已經「接受」了曾經的「錯繆」。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560121
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560121,
					"content": "只不過我走的彎路有些太多了，彌補它需要走更長的路。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560122
					],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560122,
					"content": "那…加油？用你的說法，我也沒和你熟到能給出更多建議。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [
						733560123
					],
					"speakerTitle": "「木偶」"
				},
				{
					"id": 733560123,
					"content": "哈…彼此彼此吧。",
					"roleType": "TALK_ROLE_NPC",
					"nextDialogs": [],
					"speakerTitle": "#{REALNAME[ID(1)|HOSTONLY(true)]}"
				}
			]
		},
